<title>LUXEMBOURG: EU suspends high-level talks with Iran.</title>
<headline>EU suspends high-level talks with Iran.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union foreign ministers agreed on Tuesday to suspend high-level bilateral meetings with Iran in response to a German court ruling that found Iranian government involvement in the murder of Iranian opposition figures, an EU diplomat said.</p>
<p>He said the ministers were likely later on Tuesday to agree that ambassadors from the 15 EU nations could return to Tehran if individual countries wanted them to.</p>
</text>
